        "**15. Soal:** Implementasikan fungsi untuk menghitung probabilitas kumulatif Binomial tanpa menggunakan pustaka eksternal.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Solusi:**\n",
        "\n",
        "`{python} def fact(n): return 1 if n<=1 else n*fact(n-1) def comb(n, k): return fact(n) // (fact(k) * fact(n-k)) def binom_cdf(k, n, p):     return sum(comb(n, i) * (p**i) * ((1-p)**(n-i)) for i in range(k+1))`S\n"
